## 4) GitHub Actions：打 tag → 测试 → 打包 → 发布 → 生成 Release Notes（并上传 vsix）

把下面文件保存为：`.github/workflows/publish.yml`

```yaml
name: publish

on:
  push:
    tags:
      - "v*.*.*"

permissions:
  contents: write   # 创建 GitHub Release 需要

jobs:
  publish:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest

    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v4

      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4
        with:
          node-version: "20"
          cache: "npm"

      - name: Install
        run: npm ci

      - name: Lint
        run: npm run lint --if-present

      - name: Build
        run: npm run compile --if-present

      - name: Test (VS Code integration tests)
        run: npm test

      # 可选：确保 tag 版本与 package.json 一致（强烈建议）
      - name: Verify version matches tag
        run: |
          TAG="${GITHUB_REF_NAME#v}"
          PKG=$(node -p "require('./package.json').version")
          echo "tag=$TAG package.json=$PKG"
          test "$TAG" = "$PKG"

      - name: Package VSIX
        run: npm run package

      - name: Publish to VS Code Marketplace
        run: npm run deploy
        env:
          VSCE_PAT: ${{ secrets.VSCE_PAT }}

      # 生成 GitHub Release + 自动 Release Notes + 上传 vsix
      - name: Create GitHub Release (auto notes) and upload VSIX
        env:
          GH_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}
        run: |
          gh release create "${GITHUB_REF_NAME}" dist/*.vsix \
            --title "${GITHUB_REF_NAME}" \
            --generate-notes
```

这里用的是 GitHub CLI 的 `gh release create --generate-notes`，会生成 GitHub 的“自动 Release Notes”。([GitHub CLI][4])

