## C) GitHub Actions：打 tag 自动发布（发布到 Marketplace + GitHub Release Notes + 上传 vsix）

新建文件：`.github/workflows/publish.yml`

> 触发方式：推送 tag `v15.14.6` 这种（必须跟 package.json 版本一致）

```yaml
name: publish

on:
  push:
    tags:
      - "v*.*.*"

permissions:
  contents: write  # 需要创建 GitHub Release

jobs:
  publish:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest

    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v4

      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4
        with:
          node-version: "20"
          cache: "npm"

      - name: Install
        run: npm ci

      - name: Test
        run: npm run ci:test

      - name: Verify version matches tag
        run: |
          TAG="${GITHUB_REF_NAME#v}"
          PKG=$(node -p "require('./package.json').version")
          echo "tag=$TAG package.json=$PKG"
          test "$TAG" = "$PKG"

      - name: Package VSIX
        run: npm run ci:package

      - name: Publish to VS Code Marketplace
        run: npm run ci:publish
        env:
          VSCE_PAT: ${{ secrets.VSCE_PAT }}

      - name: Create GitHub Release (auto notes) and upload VSIX
        env:
          GH_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}
        run: |
          gh release create "${GITHUB_REF_NAME}" dist/*.vsix \
            --title "${GITHUB_REF_NAME}" \
            --generate-notes
```

关键点：

* Marketplace 发布用 `VSCE_PAT` 环境变量注入（你已经在 GitHub Secrets 配好了）。
* GitHub Release Notes 用 `--generate-notes` 自动生成。
* 用 Linux runner 发布，避免 Windows 打包可能出现的可执行位问题（官方提醒）。

